OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening with late sunshine. Cloud
OL,7,Fmelting away for many overnight to
OL,8,Fleave clear spells and a few mist and
OL,9,Ffog patches. Cloud building from the
OL,10,Ffar northwest by dawn with a breeze
OL,11,Fpicking up.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA bright start, but any
OL,14,Fsunny spells will be short lived, as
OL,15,Fcloud increases from the north.
OL,16,FOutbreaks of rain arriving across
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon with some heavier
OL,18,Fbursts. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
