OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud around
OL,7,Fon Sunday before another area of rain
OL,8,Farrives from the west for Monday.
OL,9,FTurning rather showery on Tuesday,
OL,10,Fwith a risk of thunder.
